# packages/ui — design system

- Presentational components only. No `useAuth`, no Convex, no Solito, no screen-level logic.
- **Gluestack v3 + NativeWind** — add primitives via `npx gluestack-ui add <component>` inside `packages/ui`.
- Theme tokens live in `src/components/ui/gluestack-ui-provider/config.ts` — customize palette there, not in ad-hoc StyleSheet files.
- Style with NativeWind utility classes on Gluestack/RN components. Do not add new raw `StyleSheet.create` components.
- Export every public component from `packages/ui/index.ts`.
- Export `UIProvider` and `@app-template/ui/global.css` for app shells.
- Components accept props for variants/state; they do not fetch data or navigate.
- Export Gluestack primitives from `packages/ui/index.ts` (e.g. `Button`, `ButtonText`, `Input`, `InputField`). Do not add thin wrappers in `src/components/` unless a stable public API truly needs it.
- Screen layout and product-specific styling belong in `@app-template/app`, not here.

Example: add a primitive, then export it:

```
packages/ui/src/components/ui/card/   # via gluestack-ui add
packages/ui/index.ts                  # export { Card } from './src/components/ui/card'
```
